# A host reassert of a fact a rule emitted, recorded as the input it is
# ([RFCS.6.7], [RARC.5.8.10]). `raise_alarm` emits a logical Alarm; the host
# then asserts an identical one, a no-op reassertion that is still an input
# that arrived, recorded as a FactAssert against the live Alarm. The trace
# differential cannot see the record; `verify channels` and `verify
# recordings` can.
assert Reading entity_id=kitchen high=true
pump
assert Alarm entity_id=kitchen
pump
